@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor #F8F9FA
  BorderColor #2D6A4F
}
skinparam arrow {
  Color #2D6A4F
}

title Secuencia: Realizar Diagnóstico

actor "Ing. Agrónomo" as User
boundary "Navegador" as Browser
boundary "Frontend (React)" as Frontend
boundary "Backend (Express)" as Backend
boundary "Multer" as Upload
boundary "Prisma ORM" as DB
boundary "Roboflow API" as Roboflow

User -> Browser: 1. Selecciona imagen (JPEG/PNG)
Browser -> Frontend: 2. onChange -> handleImageChange()
Frontend -> Frontend: 3. Crea ObjectURL\npara preview
Frontend -> Browser: 4. Muestra preview
User -> Browser: 5. Selecciona caficultor
Browser -> Frontend: 6. onChange -> setCaficultorId()
User -> Browser: 7. Click "Realizar Diagnóstico"
Browser -> Frontend: 8. Submit formulario

Frontend -> Backend: 9. POST /api/diagnosis\nmultipart/form-data
Backend -> Upload: 10. Multer procesa archivo
Upload -> Backend: 11. File guardado en /app/uploads/
Backend -> DB: 12. prisma.diagnostico.create()
DB --> Backend: 13. Diagnóstico creado (pendiente)

Backend -> Backend: 14. fs.readFileSync()\nimagen desde disco
Backend -> Backend: 15. cleanImageBuffer()\nquita cabeceras MIME
Backend -> Roboflow: 16. POST detect.roboflow.com\nbase64 + api_key
Roboflow --> Backend: 17. predictions[] o vacío
alt No hay predicciones
  Backend -> Roboflow: 18. Fallback: classify.roboflow.com
  Roboflow --> Backend: 19. predictions[]
end

Backend -> Backend: 20. Selecciona mejor\npredicción (mayor confianza)
Backend -> DB: 21. prisma.diagnostico.update()\nresultado + confianza
DB --> Backend: 22. Diagnóstico actualizado

Backend --> Frontend: 23. 201 JSON {id, resultado,\nconfianza, caficultor}
Frontend -> Frontend: 24. setResult(data)
Frontend -> Browser: 25. Renderiza SeverityBadge,\nbarra de confianza,\nrecomendación

@enduml
